    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack fast. Crash harder. Get certified.</strong><br>Forklift Certified: Stacked &amp; Loaded is a chaotic 4-player couch co-op party game where you and your crew take on the ultimate warehouse challenge. Load crates, dodge disasters, and try not to trip over the inventory\u2014or each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together (or not) through <strong>stacks of levels</strong> escalating in logistical madness, from calm tutorial bays to frantic arenas full of crates, conveyor belts, and unpredictable warehouse hazards. Whether you're in the same room or using <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>, teamwork is optional\u2014fun is guaranteed.<br><br>\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Couch Co-op</strong>: Play locally or via <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crate-Loads of Levels</strong>: From smooth operations to total catastrophe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Certified Chaos</strong>: Drift, crash, launch, and occasionally deliver crates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Achievements</strong>: Track your progress through the game and be rewarded.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack fast. Crash harder. Get certified.</strong><br>Forklift Certified: Stacked &amp; Loaded is a chaotic 4-player couch co-op party game where you and your crew take on the ultimate warehouse challenge. Load crates, dodge disasters, and try not to trip over the inventory\u2014or each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together (or not) through <strong>stacks of levels</strong> escalating in logistical madness, from calm tutorial bays to frantic arenas full of crates, conveyor belts, and unpredictable warehouse hazards. Whether you're in the same room or using <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>, teamwork is optional\u2014fun is guaranteed.<br><br>\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Couch Co-op</strong>: Play locally or via <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crate-Loads of Levels</strong>: From smooth operations to total catastrophe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Certified Chaos</strong>: Drift, crash, launch, and occasionally deliver crates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Achievements</strong>: Track your progress through the game and be rewarded.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Chaos meets co-op in this fast-paced forklift frenzy! Team up with up to 4 players to stack, crash, and (barely) survive the warehouse floor. Master the forks, dodge disaster, and deliver perfection\u2014kinda. You're not just licensed... you're Forklift Certified!",
